    "body": "Problem: `vim.pack` inherits `GIT_INDEX_FILE` when Nvim is started as a Git editor. Plugin checkout can then leave an empty installation or fail to update it.\n\nSolution: Unset `GIT_INDEX_FILE` alongside `GIT_DIR` and `GIT_WORK_TREE` for plugin Git commands, including the pack LSP and health helpers. Extend the install, update, and hover tests with an unrelated repository index; the install and update tests also check that the index and caller environment remain unchanged.\n\nFixes #42113.\n\nValidation: The install and update tests fail before the original fix. After the LSP and health follow-up, `make functionaltest TEST_FILE=test/functional/plugin/pack_spec.lua` passes 65 tests, with one network integration test skipped. StyLua and `git diff --check` pass.\n\nAI-assisted.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-30T21:01:29Z",
