        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "There are other repository-local variables, such as `GIT_COMMON_DIR`, `GIT_OBJECT_DIRECTORY`, and `GIT_ALTERNATE_OBJECT_DIRECTORIES`; this list is not exhaustive. Git exposes that category through [`git rev-parse --local-env-vars`](https://git-scm.com/docs/git-rev-parse#Documentation/git-rev-parse.txt---local-env-vars).\n\nI would avoid an allowlist for the entire environment because plugin clones can need `SSH_AUTH_SOCK`, proxy settings, or `GIT_SSH_COMMAND`. This patch keeps the existing filtering policy and adds the variable reproduced in #42113. A broader repository-local cleanup could follow separately with coverage for those cases.\n",
