        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "If this fixes the #42113 (as @averms seems to have confirmed), then this looks like a relatively harmless tweak (hopefully). I would not want to go down the rabbit hole of evaluating and keeping track which environment variables can do harm in some rare edge cases.\r\n\r\n@jakezwang, there are also instances in the in-process lsp (`runtime/lua/vim/pack/_lsp.lua`) and health check (`runtime/lua/vim/pack/health.lua`) of special handling `GIT_*` variables. I'd think that adding `GIT_INDEX_FILE` there (with also one test update in `assert_hover()``) is also worth it, at least for consistency.",
